# Environment example (optional / local scripts only)
#
# Cueglass does NOT load any of these from this file at runtime.
# Pick a provider and paste its key in Settings → API; each key is stored
# in its own macOS Keychain entry.
#
# NEVER commit a real key. `.env` is gitignored — keep this example only.

# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...      # also required for voice input (Whisper/Stream), regardless of provider
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...
